{"3527120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legromante", "steam_appid": 3527120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic point-and-click adventure game where you play as Apolonio da Caere, a connoisseur of forbidden arts whose mission is to investigate the strange events and horrific crimes that occurred in Monforte de Lemos in 1399. In this game, you'll explore more than 45 scenes to progress toward the first step of a deep and dark story with touches of humor. If you want to enjoy the old-school aesthetic of early graphic adventures, you can play in &quot;Nostalgia Mode.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic point-and-click adventure game where you play as Apolonio da Caere, a connoisseur of forbidden arts whose mission is to investigate the strange events and horrific crimes that occurred in Monforte de Lemos in 1399. In this game, you'll explore more than 45 scenes to progress toward the first step of a deep and dark story with touches of humor. If you want to enjoy the old-school aesthetic of early graphic adventures, you can play in &quot;Nostalgia Mode.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Legromante is a point-and-click graphic adventure in which you must investigate the strange events that occurred in the year of Our Lord 1399, a time when both Providence and the Demiurge provided you with the tools to intervene in the Work with subtle touches of forbidden art...", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527120/21b53fd8826da833b76e2ff630b621e48c1f6370/header.jpg?t=1785744027", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527120/61d0507bba958335337e61ff7b08ebe0e40f96a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785744027", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai